"tagline": "Toggle peak matching for Ableton tracks",
"description": "GainSnap measures an incoming track peak while Match is enabled, applies the gain needed to reach a chosen target when Match is disabled, and holds that gain until the next measurement. Normalize sets the target to 0 dBFS and starts Match in one click. The vertical meter shows a smoothed orange incoming peak with a dB scale. A small triangle beside the meter marks the target and acts as the target control.",
